-<#
-    APPLY_ICONFESS_PLATFORM.ps1
-
-    Applies the backend platform work to a local clone of
-    https://github.com/Teamthy/i-confess.git and prepares the commit.
-
-    What it does
-      1. Verifies you are in the right repo on the expected base commit.
-      2. Writes every changed/new file (embedded, gzip+base64 - no network).
-      3. Untracks the 15.7 MB committed binary and the .history/ editor
-         backups, which bloat every clone.
-      4. Runs gofmt / go vet / go test so you never push a red build.
-      5. Prints `git status` and the exact commit+push commands.
-
-    It does NOT commit or push for you. Review the diff first.
-
-    Usage
-      powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\APPLY_ICONFESS_PLATFORM.ps1
-      ...add -SkipTests to write files without running the Go test suite.
